{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "448d3b7a0afe513b7b7497f1a3d19888195a9aa57b3a29473d2ff5d773260291", "ja": "モテカワリサーチ、開始！", "zh": "招桃花的可爱研究，开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "38a4e7269cc130cb5f479a5cd0405dd3cd8b396de9a20f61cb4ec37399eb862f", "ja": "『りるきゃん』読者の市場調査のため、\n街へと繰り出す3人とプロデューサー。\nユニットのテーマを決めると言いながらも、\n3人は買い物の楽しさについテンションが\n上がってしまい、結局テーマは決まらない。", "zh": "为了进行《莉露甜心》读者的市场调查，\n三位偶像与制作人浩浩荡荡来到市区。\n虽然说要决定团体的主题，\n但三人买得不亦乐乎，\n结果主题还是没有定下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "232939a8e920504adc31c644e3da669a0d9bfa3508e3196b0fd559850d4190fb", "ja": "（今日は『りるきゃん』読者の市場調査のため、\n翼、茜、可憐の3人と街に出かけることになった）", "zh": "（今天为了进行《莉露甜心》读者的市场调查，\n我和翼、茜、可怜三个人一起来到市区。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "08597da915a4837c26a3c6b3c2758a51500cc64e0120e21c758c5d9e48b0641c", "ja": "{$P$}さ～んっ！\nこっちこっち～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！\n这边这边～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e717b10541a7ce88273bc98ad1097d85d8e8bdc8fd00c47e7a311d7ebb10c244", "ja": "3人とも、ずいぶん早くから集合してたんだな。\nというか……翼、ずいぶん楽しそうに見えるけど。", "zh": "你们三个来得还真早呢。\n等一下……翼，我看你好像很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3f1e2617e14477f01863cca7b91ce1776b8850af0a1fafdf216f1cad79aa6417", "ja": "いいか、今日は仕事だからな。\n普通に遊びに来たつもりになるんじゃないぞ？", "zh": "听好了，今天可是来工作的。\n你可别当作是平常来玩的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d2bddc24cfab2e2ef83fe4c57dbfabe2d83682b0ef620a39b75bd01be724be80", "ja": "えへへ♪　だって、ここって普段からよく来る\nお店だし、お仕事ってカンジがしないな～って。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪因为这里的店我很常来啊，\n感觉根本不像来工作的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "182b28488fd6620bf1ce677be4da2a0980923de570a92a8ad7ef93db1c9accc7", "ja": "茜ちゃんもたまに来るよ！　猫の手に猫耳に\n猫しっぽ……なんと、猫セット一式が揃っちゃうのだ！", "zh": "小茜偶尔也会来喔！猫掌、猫耳、猫尾巴……\n太惊奇啦！这里竟然有卖猫的全套装备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0e2537a472e6a2c0213af2fddd7850569b2932c197e7c6ecfb72c85eb94eb832", "ja": "そうそう！　カワイイアイテムとか、プチプラの\nファッションアイテムがいっぱいのお店なんですよ～♪", "zh": "对啊对啊！这间店有很多可爱的服饰，\n还有平价的时尚商品喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "ff181f02ce87e84544c520c54ddfecf699d28bc6248f40b8d171bf5951b3c0ce", "ja": "わ、私は、初めて来ました……。茜ちゃん、\n翼ちゃん、いろいろ、お、教えてください……！", "zh": "我、我是第一次来这里……小茜、小翼，\n请你们、多、多多指教……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "5fbfde594c1ae1c2713915995ff8014798a75e6c031cea35fd7569acc8dc4093", "ja": "よくぞ茜ちゃんを頼ってくれたね、可憐ちゃん！\n頼まれたらイヤとは言えない茜ちゃんだからね！", "zh": "交给小茜就对了，小可怜！\n小茜受人之托，是不可能拒绝的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b55d2ade9e07ab6e757d042d6a8daf5efc9b6fb52f90c1c4cd0c1fb4ec57aa3", "ja": "わたしも、いろいろ教えてあげちゃいま～す！\nえっと、可憐さんには何が似合うかな～？", "zh": "我也会教你很多东西喔～！\n我想想，可怜适合怎样的风格呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f98cf04878289b4d186e322d8c6b90aec787b83f59019846507052e6479eb486", "ja": "翼、茜……。もう一度言っておくけど、\n今日は仕事だからな？", "zh": "翼、茜……我再强调一次，\n今天是来工作的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d6b14ce90def99732f6bd818f8d4d232695f55c58f5320a0ab566189e39db80f", "ja": "も～、わかってますってば～。あ！　じゃあ今日は、\nわたし達のユニットテーマを決めることにしませんか？", "zh": "真是的～我们知道啦～啊！这样的话，\n不如今天就来决定我们团体的主题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "88accad26e8aa82020d8a3dfacef947e2fa99a047e1149080293eadb0bc14a9c", "ja": "ユニットテーマか……。\nうん、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "团体主题是吗……\n嗯，听起来不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0780913cd0dc7e6e84cd27751bf910a15046b096fb1e78b14ddf2dc7313c71df", "ja": "でしょ？\nわたし達にぴったりのテーマ、考えてみますね♪", "zh": "对吧？\n一起来想想适合我们的主题吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "c9ad9580047e1f73ff80cf1c4753ab5ebed19f27236d2baad86fe07614b6bb6f", "ja": "それじゃあ、エンジェリックニャンニャンズの\nみんな！　お店に突撃だ～！", "zh": "那么，天使喵喵女孩的各位团员！\n向店里发动突击吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "cc273792d8149c96a80b95c9f8268a54bdd977a6213150893bfb4c0df00602ee", "ja": "は、はい……。\n……エンジェリックニャンニャンズ……？", "zh": "好、好的……\n……天使喵喵女孩……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5eb3dd93fcd7160dd4a595fc7a05382741f732879fd305b7669d42cd6bb2e4e7", "ja": "ちょっと、茜ちゃん！\n勝手にユニット名決めないでくださいよ～！", "zh": "等一下，小茜！\n不要擅自决定团体名称啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ad56f57c7946718936e1497edfe049fd63bd095a7a68a33b87d7e5595d96bd20", "ja": "おっと。\n俺もついていかないと、見失いそうだな……。", "zh": "糟糕，\n我得快跟上，不然会走失的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e10edb45ed41231279de4ef2fc5f37718b3e1dcf9675c26ce79b4ab019a5ea24", "ja": "じゃーん！　どうですか？\nこのアクセサリー、似合ってるでしょ？", "zh": "锵锵──！怎么样呢？\n这个饰品很适合吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "54223b76375a93a93bccf38b3f318882e8da8204bd4817bc47f439ac6ba1b355", "ja": "翼ちゃん、とってもカワイイよ！\nけど、茜ちゃんのコーデのほうが一枚上手かな～。", "zh": "小翼，这样搭很可爱喔！\n不过，小茜的穿搭可是技高一筹呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0418c5fb774d2630254a630956faae000260c0cfc032a8a1f64efa78eb21d363", "ja": "えーっ！　茜ちゃんのもカワイイけど、\n今のは、わたしの勝ちだと思うな～。", "zh": "会吗──！？小茜的是很可爱没错，\n但我觉得应该算我赢吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "37836db4eeecd62a7a7812b3e4a743f6bec657b57399cc68acaaa79bb5374464", "ja": "ふっふっふ……茜ちゃんは今、16歳！　少女と\n大人、その狭間の色気が翼ちゃんに出せるかな！？", "zh": "哼哼哼……小茜现年16岁！\n这种介于少女与成人之间的性感，小翼你拿得出来吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "c75859a558dd5afec87a60daa7425ed7e82ccb8e3444bbbacac102cdfbc5c287", "ja": "（さすが、ショップの常連。\n早速、売り物を試着して遊び始めたぞ……）", "zh": "（不愧是店里的常客。\n马上就开始试穿商品，玩了起来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "f8402ec773a6d6d8485abcd416f74d5485808883fb31f1629ac48b694bb9dfc9", "ja": "わぁ……か、かわいい……。\nいろんな色のストーンの、リング……。", "zh": "哇……好、好可爱……\n有好多颜色的、石头戒指……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "b41526a927e80bbfbbc1125c4109d259baa84a18ab2ac225faa8e023a6490864", "ja": "か、重ね付けしたら……、\n地味な私でも、派手に見える……かな……。", "zh": "搭、搭配在一起的话……\n像我这么不起眼的人，也会变得……很华丽吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "9681b129cfba083c527c20f15efb3ed4a6893936d9c045013b8cef90cd6923c1", "ja": "（可憐も可憐で楽しんでいるみたいだな。\n女の子って、ホントこういうところが好きだよな……）", "zh": "（可怜也自己乐在其中呢。\n女生真的很喜欢这种地方……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "629175402963c943f8744ae00442933880b4b5c3999e9b6eb788408f49ad6ff5", "ja": "それじゃあ次は、お洋服選びに行きましょー！\nレッツゴー！", "zh": "接下来，去挑衣服吧──！\nLet's go──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "12fa60a7149d4732a66d1ccaaa097f9a1f5602c0f4caf68167c044dccfca1426", "ja": "イェーイ！", "zh": "耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "54b5105bb1d8babc8bb1fa15bd024f4554e18fe8a739f69147f8f4f8a5a7c806", "ja": "ああっ、ま、待ってください～……！", "zh": "啊啊！请、请等一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "67f4dab93623eae57251f8d5d259df5357fe558a757f4f6bf9ca9aa36aa54c1a", "ja": "（やれやれ、3人の買い物が終わるまで、付き合うしか\nなさそうだな。まあ、市場調査だと思えばいいか……）", "zh": "（真是的，看来只能陪她们三个买完东西了。\n算了，就当作是做市场调查吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "61cce27e53bbad4a69c07ab790b1825ba52bb807e9786c0a51a87065934a726d", "ja": "はーっ、楽しかった！\n気になってたアイテム、いろいろ買えちゃいました♪", "zh": "呼──真开心！\n买了好多想要的单品喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "8dceedce104a24c8a8f4d3b98c48998de204ace6ce2c1ec01b820bac1fc431b3", "ja": "わ、私も……かわいいお洋服やアクセサリー、\nいろいろ買っちゃいました……♪", "zh": "我、我也……\n买了很多可爱的衣服和饰品……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "aea907affee46d9e71c386eb83006d9d4787dd0a8f7a250f5378b5ed5a412faa", "ja": "茜ちゃんたち、ますますカワイくなっちゃうね。\n世界中のカワイイが、今、劇場に集まってるのかな？", "zh": "小茜我们变得越来越可爱了。\n全世界的可爱元素现在都汇集到剧场来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1040_p", "source_sha256": "e3932776982f51dedf89fc67bc976d26afa85ef284ff4323b6ef554102b1b8c3", "ja": "楽しい買い物だったようで何よりだけど、\nユニットのテーマは決まったのか？", "zh": "看你们都买得很开心就好，不过，\n团体的主题决定了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4a6fe52617316b69fd9945fd178a4c92aa53ac3dd396233380c88c627905530a", "ja": "テーマ？\n……って、なんだっけ？", "zh": "主题？\n……什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "65dc8c088dc810e3fbbf6c84da5fc0986023e4d845bc0553adce1d221a2c4d7f", "ja": "翼が言い出したんだろ……忘れちゃったのか？\nユニットのテーマだよ。", "zh": "翼，这不是你自己说的吗……难道你忘了？\n就是团体的主题啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7abfafa87d329a94e1eb3dd06c9860c430ebec9dd5ac07b9f39390667a809a85", "ja": "あっ、そうでした。\n買い物が楽しくて、つい……えへへ♪", "zh": "啊！我都忘了。\n因为买东西太开心了，不小心就……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "d638f541fe251aa6893ce7ff5711a442e6ecb2b530ebb86f1a6d5d8cfa595d9d", "ja": "今日は市場調査はばっちりできたから、\nテーマは後日でいいんじゃないかニャ？", "zh": "今天市场调查做得这么彻底了，\n主题改天再想就好了喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "90b33869217ad996b9ab2a5ed576c39ba38b449db0ebef72e657b8825c044df2", "ja": "そうだよね！　茜ちゃん、いいこと言う～♪\nテーマは帰ってから考えまーす！", "zh": "就是说啊！小茜，说得好～♪\n我回家后会开始想主题的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1046_045kar", "source_sha256": "8fac464b9e4d5d10bbc64bb19488cee47ef5d8eec878dbf7f53dd349e1191ac8", "ja": "わ、私も、考えてみますね。\nぴったりの、テーマ……！", "zh": "我、我也会想想看的。\n最适合我们的、主题……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "cfb8f78366368e0c90ae65f0620accce7b918778dddf0a5406e45af9e777f9b9", "ja": "（結局、3人の買い物に\n付き合わされただけだったような……）", "zh": "（结果，我今天就只是\n来陪她们三个买东西而已……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "ae2377f6437ebc7a81f2ca56bca530e84887fa3ec79c97208f9d04b02933a49b", "ja": "（まあ、ターゲット層の女の子達がどんなものに\n興味があるかは、少しわかった気がする）", "zh": "（算了，至少我稍微理解目标客群的\n女孩子们喜欢怎样的东西了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
